	(text "BUS: THE CARD'S BLOCK (7000-7FFF): TEXT RAM, REGISTERS, GFX WINDOW" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86997819-fdc7-5a7f-9d25-7d517fa0b768"))
	(text "Memory-mapped, no I/O ports. IC1 latches A8-A15 while TPA is high; IC2 compares A12-A15 with the BLOCK jumper (1-2\nonly = block 7) while -VMA is low -> BOARDSEL. A11 low: -TXTCE, the text RAM 7000-77FF (IC20D). A11 high: UPPER,\n7800-7FFF (IC18D); in it A10 high = WSEL, the GFX window 7C00-7FFF (IC19D), A10 low = the registers, from A1-A2\n(repeating to 7BFF): IC5 the 6845's -CS (7800/7801, RS = A0); IC6 reads while -MRD low (7802 key, 7804 status, 7806\nmouse; the 6845 is not read); IC7 writes while -MRW low (7800 6845, 7804 control, 7806 Y). RN2: pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f243ea78-d42f-52a1-a864-dab90a47bf76"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
